WEBVTT

00:05:57.853 --> 00:06:00.856
geographic boundaries no longer mattered.

00:06:00.856 --> 00:06:04.735
This digital workspace meant
virtually no startup or scaling costs.

00:06:04.735 --> 00:06:07.405
So we've been able to grow
and make incredible changes

00:06:07.405 --> 00:06:11.325
with a budget of only 9,000 dollars
over two and a half years.

00:06:11.951 --> 00:06:15.413
It was only after I began to see
this profound potential for impact

00:06:15.454 --> 00:06:18.165
that I realized that virtual organizations

00:06:18.207 --> 00:06:21.168
can help us better distribute
educational resources

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:24.463
directly to those who would
benefit from them the most.

00:06:24.505 --> 00:06:26.799
And if this worked in classical music,

00:06:26.841 --> 00:06:29.301
I figured it can work
in other places, too.

00:06:29.343 --> 00:06:32.263
This time in academic research.